{"schema_version": 1, "operation_id": "operation-f72cc33f0af54ad285a66adcb4d05618", "created_at": "2026-10-13T05:34:44.442729+00:00", "request": {"url": "https://www.37.com/sgby/article.html?id=10", "formats": ["markdown"], "onlyMainContent": true, "onlyCleanContent": false, "maxAge": 0, "skipTlsVerification": false, "timeout": 60000}, "response": {"success": true, "data": {"markdown": "- [_HOME_ 官网首页](https://www.37.com/sgby/)\n- [_NEWS_ 资讯中心](https://www.37.com/sgby/list.html?cate=xinwen&page=1)\n- [_GUIDE_ 游戏攻略](https://www.37.com/sgby/list.html?cate=gonglue&page=1)\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/06/05114606K6m1q.png)\n\n扫一扫 下载游戏\n\nios下载安卓下载\n\n您的位置：\n[霸业](https://www.37.com/sgby/index.html) >\n>\n玩法介绍-比武场\n\n#### 玩法介绍-比武场\n\n作者：37网游2022-08-04 23:29:00\n\n**比武场的基础玩法是什么？**\n\n《霸业》比武场是一种PVP玩法，通过小组赛、争霸赛最终决出前三名。\n\n1、比武场需要主公手动报名参加，未报名主公不能参与本届比武大会；\n\n2、前七轮为小组赛，每4人一组，胜者两名进入下一轮，前七轮决出8强进入争霸赛，冠军赛为单局淘汰制，胜利者进入下一轮，最后决出天下第一\n\n3、争霸赛开打之前可对争霸赛冠军进行押注，押注胜利后可获得奖励\n\n4、在战斗正式开始之前玩家可以调整阵容和出场顺序；\n\n5、根据比武大会的排名可以获得称号以及丰富的奖励（具体奖励以游戏内实际为准）。\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593478648033.jpg)\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593478759371.jpg)", "metadata": {"keywords": "", "language": "en", "title": "《霸业》官方网站", "description": "", "favicon": "https://img1.37wanimg.com/www/images/common/37/favicon.ico", "scrapeId": "01a133c1-3c58-73cb-91ae-3f83cac6829b", "sourceURL": "https://www.37.com/sgby/article.html?id=10", "url": "https://www.37.com/sgby/article.html?id=10", "statusCode": 200, "contentType": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "timezone": "America/New_York", "proxyUsed": "basic", "indexId": "fac9d50a-2d6a-4bc8-8e6a-8960801af48c", "creditsUsed": 1, "concurrencyLimited": false}}}, "http_status": 200, "error_code": null, "fetched_at": "2026-10-13T05:34:43+00:00"}
