{"schema_version": 1, "operation_id": "operation-a1d6ffd7dde8468b9257218c47f36608", "created_at": "2026-10-13T05:39:02.159115+00:00", "request": {"url": "https://sgby.6711.com/article.html?id=20", "formats": ["markdown"], "onlyMainContent": true, "onlyCleanContent": false, "maxAge": 0, "skipTlsVerification": false, "timeout": 60000}, "response": {"success": true, "data": {"markdown": "- [_HOME_ 官网首页](https://sgby.6711.com/)\n- [_NEWS_ 资讯中心](https://sgby.6711.com/list.html?cate=xinwen&page=1)\n- [_GUIDE_ 游戏攻略](https://sgby.6711.com/list.html?cate=gonglue&page=1)\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/06/05114606K6m1q.png)\n\n扫一扫 下载游戏\n\nios下载安卓下载\n\n您的位置：\n[霸业](https://sgby.6711.com/index.html) >\n>\n系统介绍-爵位系统\n\n#### 系统介绍-爵位系统\n\n作者：37网游2022-08-04 23:38:00\n\n**爵位的基础玩法是什么？**\n\n1、玩家爵位总计有11个等级，分为公士，中大夫，国大夫，上卿，列侯，男爵，子爵，伯爵，侯爵，公爵与王爵。同时爵位的提升需要完成相应的任务条件，包括不限于完成相应的累计军务次数，拥有X件宝物，累计获得XX战绩，累计占领XX做产业等等。\n\n2、提升爵位后可以提高官邸等级的上限，同时也能通过消耗战功与银币解锁相应的爵位特权，包括增加武将行军速度，增加国战战功获取数量，可编组部队数量，增加每日免费军务次数等等功能。\n\n![168593389920873.jpg](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593389920873.jpg)\n\n**爵位等级如何提升？**\n\n玩家需要通过完成爵位设置的子任务提升爵位等级。\n\n部分爵位等级预览：\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593389932649.jpg)\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593389988209.jpg)\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593389932459.jpg)\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593389973464.jpg)\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593389947508.jpg)\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593389998530.jpg)\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593389954569.jpg)\n\n验证码\n\n安全验证\n\n返回\n\n拖动下方滑块完成拼图\n\n确定\n\n![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\nAI生成背景\n\n![success](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n我不会\n\n![](<Base64-Image-Remov