{"schema_version": 1, "operation_id": "operation-33470791ced746a3a2abfcb84d0def1c", "created_at": "2026-10-13T05:40:31.419708+00:00", "request": {"url": "https://sgby.6711.com/article.html?id=18", "formats": ["markdown"], "onlyMainContent": true, "onlyCleanContent": false, "maxAge": 0, "skipTlsVerification": false, "timeout": 60000}, "response": {"success": true, "data": {"markdown": "- [_HOME_ 官网首页](https://sgby.6711.com/)\n- [_NEWS_ 资讯中心](https://sgby.6711.com/list.html?cate=xinwen&page=1)\n- [_GUIDE_ 游戏攻略](https://sgby.6711.com/list.html?cate=gonglue&page=1)\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/06/05114606K6m1q.png)\n\n扫一扫 下载游戏\n\nios下载安卓下载\n\n您的位置：\n[霸业](https://sgby.6711.com/index.html) >\n>\n系统介绍-官职系统\n\n#### 系统介绍-官职系统\n\n作者：37网游2022-08-04 23:37:00\n\n**官职的基础玩法是什么？**\n\n1、在每个国家设有刺史，镇东、镇北、镇南、镇西将军，太傅，太尉，丞相，尚书令，司马，司空，司徒12个官职，每个官职都拥有相应的职能，可以在国家内发号施令。第二天刺史战之后会解锁如下官职：\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593410485293.jpg)\n\n2、当本国占领两座指定都城时，刺史将会进阶为州牧，当刺史官职进阶时，其他官职也会进阶。同事解锁拥有国战时战力加成的左、右都侯。\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593410475271.jpg)\n\n当本国占领3座指定都城时，州牧将会进阶为王。左、右都侯进阶为四方将军\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593410437657.jpg)\n\n当本国占领4座指定都城与1座选占都城时，王将会进阶为帝，并且全国税收将提升至120%。\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593410425601.jpg)\n\n3、官职称号会在聊天栏显示，玩家可以消耗元宝弹劾国王，由战力前10玩家投票表决弹劾结果。\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593410491138.jpg)", "metadata": {"title": "《霸业》官方网站", "keywords": "", "description": "", "language": "en", "favicon": "https://img1.37wanimg.com/www/images/common/37/favicon.ico", "scrapeId": "01a133c6-be86-75e9-b040-904c4cc13004", "sourceURL": "https://sgby.6711.com/article.html?id=18", "url": "https://sgby.6711.com/article.html?id=18", "statusCode": 200, "contentType": "text/html", "timezone": "America/New_York", "proxyUsed": "basic", "indexId": "a520f8be-be65-4f9e-b304-d8874fbe7e26", "creditsUsed": 1, "concurrencyLimited": false}}}, "http_status": 200, "error_code": null, "fetched_at": "2026-10-13T05:40:30+00:00"}
