{"schema_version": 1, "operation_id": "operation-cf2fc2767bdb47799ceb36b19b00a31f", "created_at": "2026-10-13T05:42:01.591380+00:00", "request": {"url": "https://sgby.6711.com/article.html?id=49", "formats": ["markdown"], "onlyMainContent": true, "onlyCleanContent": false, "maxAge": 0, "skipTlsVerification": false, "timeout": 60000}, "response": {"success": true, "data": {"markdown": "- [_HOME_ 官网首页](https://sgby.6711.com/)\n- [_NEWS_ 资讯中心](https://sgby.6711.com/list.html?cate=xinwen&page=1)\n- [_GUIDE_ 游戏攻略](https://sgby.6711.com/list.html?cate=gonglue&page=1)\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/06/05114606K6m1q.png)\n\n扫一扫 下载游戏\n\nios下载安卓下载\n\n您的位置：\n[霸业](https://sgby.6711.com/index.html) >\n>\n玩法介绍-称王战\n\n#### 玩法介绍-称王战\n\n作者：37网游2023-06-05 11:11:00\n\n**称王战的基础玩法是什么？**\n\n称王战是《霸业》国战玩法之一，通过该玩法主公可以从州牧晋升为王。\n\n1、称王战于第1年冬季12：00~14：00进行，将开放徐州、长安、零陵三座巨型都城；\n\n2、本国成功占领目标都城，且都城占领数不少于3座，则本国州牧成功称王，并解锁四大将军官职；\n\n3、四大将军麾下英雄可获强力加成，本国主公与各将军麾下英雄共同作战时同样享受加成；\n\n4、称王战期间可通过获取战功提升个人排名获取高额奖励，结束时未领取的奖励将通过邮件发放。\n\n![168593472890250.jpg](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593472890250.jpg)\n\n验证码\n\n安全验证\n\n返回\n\n拖动下方滑块完成拼图\n\n确定\n\n![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\nAI生成背景\n\n![success](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n我不会\n\n![](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n常规验证\n\n![feedback](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n![refresh](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n![close](<Base64-Image-Removed>)\n\n确定", "metadata": {"keywords": "", "description": "", "renderer": "webkit", "viewport": "width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, minimum-scale=1, user-scalable=no", "title": "《霸业》官方网站", "language": "en", "favicon": "https://img1.37wanimg.com/www/images/common/37/favicon.ico", "scrapeId": "01a133c8-18f5-728b-8acd-3111b2b1a3ca", "sourceURL": "https:/