{"schema_version": 1, "operation_id": "operation-d7e708d1903b470e82096942d96ae603", "created_at": "2026-10-13T06:08:22.654575+00:00", "request": {"url": "https://www.37.com/sgby/article.html?id=10", "formats": ["markdown"], "onlyMainContent": true, "onlyCleanContent": false, "maxAge": 0, "skipTlsVerification": false, "timeout": 60000}, "response": {"success": true, "data": {"markdown": "- [_HOME_ 官网首页](https://www.37.com/sgby/)\n- [_NEWS_ 资讯中心](https://www.37.com/sgby/list.html?cate=xinwen&page=1)\n- [_GUIDE_ 游戏攻略](https://www.37.com/sgby/list.html?cate=gonglue&page=1)\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/06/05114606K6m1q.png)\n\n扫一扫 下载游戏\n\nios下载安卓下载\n\n您的位置：\n[霸业](https://www.37.com/sgby/index.html) >\n>\n玩法介绍-比武场\n\n#### 玩法介绍-比武场\n\n作者：37网游2022-08-04 23:29:00\n\n**比武场的基础玩法是什么？**\n\n《霸业》比武场是一种PVP玩法，通过小组赛、争霸赛最终决出前三名。\n\n1、比武场需要主公手动报名参加，未报名主公不能参与本届比武大会；\n\n2、前七轮为小组赛，每4人一组，胜者两名进入下一轮，前七轮决出8强进入争霸赛，冠军赛为单局淘汰制，胜利者进入下一轮，最后决出天下第一\n\n3、争霸赛开打之前可对争霸赛冠军进行押注，押注胜利后可获得奖励\n\n4、在战斗正式开始之前玩家可以调整阵容和出场顺序；\n\n5、根据比武大会的排名可以获得称号以及丰富的奖励（具体奖励以游戏内实际为准）。\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593478648033.jpg)\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0605/168593478759371.jpg)", "metadata": {"title": "《霸业》官方网站", "description": "", "language": "en", "keywords": "", "favicon": "https://img1.37wanimg.com/www/images/common/37/favicon.ico", "scrapeId": "01a133e0-1cbd-7134-a4ab-40d1afb2b46a", "sourceURL": "https://www.37.com/sgby/article.html?id=10", "url": "https://www.37.com/sgby/article.html?id=10", "statusCode": 200, "contentType": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "timezone": "America/New_York", "proxyUsed": "basic", "indexId": "a892ea26-625e-491b-8860-09e685985458", "creditsUsed": 1, "concurrencyLimited": false}}}, "http_status": 200, "error_code": null, "fetched_at": "2026-10-13T06:08:21+00:00"}
{"schema_version": 1, "operation_id": "operation-05e2be12e3984e8ab8a4b1d02a1410b5", "created_at": "2026-10-13T06:09:09.021774+00:00", "request": {"url": "https://sgby.6711.com/article.html?id=37", "formats": ["markdown"], "onlyMainContent": true, "onlyCleanContent": false, "maxAge": 0, "skipTlsVerification": false, "timeout": 60000}, "response": {"success": true, "data": {"markdown": "- [_HOME_ 官网首页](https://sgby.6711.com/)\n- [_NEWS_ 资讯中心](https://sgby.6711.com/list.html?cate=xinwen&page=1)\n- [_GUIDE_ 游戏攻略](https://sgby.6711.com/list.html?cate=gonglue&page=1)\n\n![](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/06/05114606K6m1q.png)\n\n扫一扫 下载游戏\n\nios下载安卓下载\n\n您的位置：\n[霸业](https://sgby.6711.com/index.html) >\n>\n霸业前瞻\\|城池—荣誉之城，誓不可让\n\n#### 霸业前瞻\\|城池—荣誉之城，誓不可让\n\n作者：37网游2023-06-06 09:46:00\n\n![168508150843866.png](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0526/168508150843866.png)\n\n对于主公来说，城池是重要的资源出产地与国势衡量基础。\n\n主公们通过攻占获得本国势力城池，连通通路，占据更多城池与资源。\n\n其中，不同的城池有不同的功能：\n\n关城是守护都城的屏障，除了拥有较高的地利加成，每座关城还配有密道，各位主公可以通过密道直接绕进对方腹地突袭。对防守方来说，关城一旦丢失，损失巨大，所以系统会有护国军每日收复失地。一句话，想要剑指对方都城，关城这道屏障，是兵家必争之地。\n\n![168508152768705.png](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0526/168508152768705.png)\n\n都城是国战的核心争夺目标，从地理位置上，占领每一个都城后对周边城池的防守都有很好的帮助。从收益上，占领更多的都城不但可以让全国官职晋升到更高品阶，还能每天为国库提供能多收入。\n\n而元宝城指能提供元宝税收的城池，每季结算时根据本国占有的元宝城数目，为国库提供元宝和银币税收。国库收入将会在每年冬季根据贡献分配给每位主公。\n\n![168508155779301.png](https://img2.37wanimg.com/2023/0526/168508155779301.png)", "metadata": {"description": "", "language": "en", "title": "《霸业》官方网站", "keywords": "", "favicon": "https://img1.37wanimg.com/www/images/common/37/favicon.ico", "scrapeId": "01a133e0-f1e2-70a8-bebc-2ac44b9236f6", "sourceURL": "https://sgby.6711.com/article.html?id=37", "url": "https://sgby.6711.com/article.html?id=37", "statusCode": 200, "contentType": "text/html", "timezone": "America/New_York", "proxyUsed": "basic", "indexId": "367d1f38-c07a-4fa3-9e45-0715aaaa7007", "creditsUsed": 1, "concurrencyLimited": false}}}, "http_status": 200, "error_code": null, "fetched_at": "2026-10-13T06:09:07+00:00"}
